    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Suppose we have an integer list where all elements of the list represent a number. Find the resulting value by adding 1 to the number."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "For example"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "python",
      "content": "digits = [1, 4, 2, 4]"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Here, all elements of the list represent a number, 1424. Now, we need to add 1 to the number. Hence, our output will be"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "python",
      "content": "[1, 4, 2, 5]"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "which is equivalent to 1424 + 1."
    },
